<https://example.org/openevidence/questions/q_hyperlipidemia_efficacy> a holon:ClinicalQuestionHolon ;
    oe:questionText "How effective is atorvastatin compared with other agents for Hyperlipidemia?"^^xsd:string ;
    oe:answerText "Patients with severe hypertriglyceridemia have an increased risk of acute pancreatitis. The efficacy and safety of olezarsen, an antisense oligonucleotide targeting apolipoprotein C-III messenger RNA, have not been established in this population."^^xsd:string ;
