    holon:hasContextGraph <https://example.org/openevidence/questions/q_hyperlipidemia_efficacy-con> ;
    holon:evidenceQualityThreshold "0.50"^^xsd:decimal .

<https://example.org/openevidence/drugs/atorvastatin> oe:treats <https://example.org/openevidence/diseases/hyperlipidemia> .
